S3A TASK V1.3 (BETA) - README
-----------------------

This file is for users of V1.2 who wish to upgrade to V1.3.

To upgrade from V1.2, simply replace the old S3ATASK2.APP with the new S3ATASK3.APP.

In the APP\S3ATASK directory remove the old S3ATASK2.OVL, as that is not required any more, and if appropriate replace the S3ATASKP.OVL file with the new one.

In the program, the changes you will see are:

a.	Printout extended desriptions now available
	
b.	Three levels of sort including sort by Description and Time now available

c.	Sheet added to Links

d.	Find now operates on Extended Text as well

e.	Agenda/Data/Word/Sheet defaults, Font setting, Terminology and Priorities are now Group specific
	
f.	The categories are added to the top line in Extended descriptiopn
	
g.	The Password is now for individual Groups

h.	You can enter a Category direct from Task Entry

i.	Backup & Restore option added for safety !!

j.	New single key press 't' = Today

k.	Unarchive - you can now specify Group

l.	Move to Position implemented (in manual sort)

m.	Block option for Delete, Archive, Strike out & Progress implemented, Use <Shift-Cursor Arrow> to 'tag' entries.

n.	Undated and Unprioritised entries are now separated.  You may need to amend existing entries that had no priority, to remove the date.

o.	last entry repeat implemented (Shift-Enter)

p.	Optional display of second category if you don't use it.


Hope you like the improvements

Cheers

Al